@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+## Unreleased
+
+- Fix `default_map` being ignored for subcommands. A child context now uses
+  the entry of the parent's `default_map` matching its command name, instead
+  of the parent's whole map.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
